This directory contains the C++ headers of ldpc 2.4.1 (https://github.com/quantumgizmos/ldpc),
the decoder library whose OSD-0 implementation the eldpc decoder uses.

  src_cpp/*.hpp            the header-only decoders (BP, OSD, and their dependencies)
  include/robin_map/*.h    tsl::robin_map by Thibaut Goetghebuer-Planchon, included by ldpc

Both are distributed under the MIT License; the full text is in LICENSE. The copyright notices of
the authors are kept in the source files.

The files are the ldpc 2.4.1 headers as vendored by the fastbpgpu6g decoder: the deterministic
column-ordering changes of that tree (explicit tie-breaks in the OSD / LSD column orders and
indices, so equal soft values sort by column index) are present. BP itself is unmodified.
